    "changes": "SRD 5.2.1 p. 100 adventuring gear (Spikes, Iron, Spyglass, String, Tent, Tinderbox, Torch, Vial, Waterskin) adapted into versioned mundane gear families with structured actions, checks, damage, measures, trait keys, pack contents, spellcasting focus classes, weights and listed prices from the entries and their tables. Names and numeric values are adapted; trait keys summarize the remaining rules, in places close to the printed wording; no rules prose is copied as text. Catalogue data grants no inventory, proficiency, action or gameplay permissions; every record is unavailable. Spell Scroll, which this catalogue batch also lists, stays owned by magic-item batch #242 and has no record here."
